# Demo of the in-engine cutscene system (Milestone 19a). Press F7 on any map.
# Positions use ~x,y (relative to the player) so it works wherever you stand.
# Command reference: scripts/cutscene/SceneScript.gd

spawn guest ryn at ~3,0 facing left
emote player !
say Ryn: There you are! I've been looking all over for you.
face player right
move guest left 1
emote guest note
say Ryn: The Cathedral is just past the gate. Stay close, and keep your guard up - they say the Unraveling is spreading through the forest, and nobody who went in has come back out yet.

spawn stranger frank at ~-3,1 facing right
camera to ~-3,1 over 0.8
emote stranger ...
narrate A hooded figure watches from the shadows.
camera reset over 0.6

emote guest ?
say Ryn: Did you hear something?
move guest right 3
despawn guest
set demo_seen
